//	LOCAL.BAN_TIMEOUT --> 5 * 60 (default), seconds to keep banned the ip from new connections to the server (permanent if negative).
// RETURN
//	1 --> Only reject the connection.
//	2 --> Reject and ban the IP for <LOCAL.BAN_TIMEOUT> seconds.




